  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid Quantum‑Enhanced Soft Actor‑Critic (QSAC) agent using a 4‑qubit, 6‑layer variational quantum circuit in the critic network for CBDC liquidity management. In simulation with an IBM‑calibrated noise model, QSAC achieves an average funding cost of 12.4 bps, about 8.1% lower than classical SAC and roughly 3.2% lower than Model Predictive Control baselines, while eliminating LCR breaches in the simulated banking environment.",
